    Rollback mit Daten  geht                                                                                            
      a failed run goes back to the previous commit and restores the backup it made before the change                   
    Backup  geht                                                                                                        
      a backup saves the data directories data/db                                                                       
    Geheimnisse schwärzen  geht                                                                                         
      the values of secrets.env (2 key(s)) are redacted in logs and messages                                            
    secrets-env-not-ignored  Warnung                                                                                    
      secrets.env is not listed in .gitignore                                                                           
